<title>JAPAN: Nihon Unisys to tie up with Digital on 3D graphics.</title>
<headline>Nihon Unisys to tie up with Digital on 3D graphics.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nihon Unisys Ltd said on Monday it had agreed to tie up with Digital Equipment Corp (DEC) on the development of three-dimensional graphics.</p>
<p>Nihon Unisys also said Digital would buy the techology and facilities for the graphics from Megatek Corp, Nihon Unisys' wholly owned unit in San Diego.</p>
<p>Nihon Unisys did not give a value for the sale.</p>
<p>Unisys Corp and Mitsui &amp; Co Ltd each hold a 31.81 percent stake in Nihon Unisys.</p>
</text>
